shuffle permutes true, moved true
same seed, same order true
shuffle of one: 5
each first about a third true
sample of 3: 3 in order and distinct true
sample of more than there are: 8
sample returns its end true
shiftLeft returns 3
shiftLeft 2: 3 4 5
shiftLeft all true none true
